Error [E0102]: `Event.queued_count` was retired
  --> tests/ui/event_queued_count_retired.jet:5:16
    |
  5 |     print(jobs.queued_count())
    |                ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Synchronous `Event<T>` dispatches immediately; only `AsyncEvent<T, E>` owns a scheduler queue
 Fix: Use `.queued_count()` on an `AsyncEvent<T, E>`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0102
